    "body": "Note for `-webkit-box-orient` (from https://hg.mozilla.org/integration/mozilla-inbound/rev/8172c825df87#l3.13):\n\n```\nthe logical property \"-webkit-box-orient\" is always mapped to\nflex-direction\", but its values (\"horizontal\", \"vertical\") map to\ndifferent flex-direction values (\"row\", \"column\") depending on the\nwriting-mode.\n```\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
